# What ships in the Composer package is what a consumer's application can
# actually use: src/, docs/, and the licence. Everything else is for people
# working *in* this repository.
#
# There used to be a `/.opencode` line here, for the agent skills. They are not
# in this repository any more — they moved to `../dev/`, along with the
# AGENTS.md and the planning files, because they are workspace material rather
# than this package's. Nothing to ignore now: a path that is not here cannot be
# exported.
#
# The reasoning behind that move is worth keeping: add-route/SKILL.md points at
# tests/RoutingTest.php and describes a repository layout — in someone else's
# vendor/ directory that path does not exist, and the instruction is worse than
# absent. Keeping them out of the package is one half of that; putting them in a
# sibling repository that a consumer never has is the other.
/tests          export-ignore
/tools          export-ignore
/.editorconfig  export-ignore
/phpunit.xml    export-ignore
